---
source: crates/strata_rules/src/descriptor/card/tests.rs
expression: "rendered.join(\"\\n\")"
---
{to} add {amount} to their {stat}.
  => Adjacent friendly soldier figures add 1 to their defense.
After {after}ing, roll the d20; on {at_least} or more, {effect}.
  => After attacking, roll the d20; on 16 or more, this figure may take 1 extra attack action.
Add {amount} to {stat} while {when}.
  => Add 1 to attack while higher than the target.
{when}, roll the d20; on {at_least} or more, {effect}.
  => During a ranged attack, roll the d20; on 17 or more, the attack deals no wounds.
{when}, after the defense roll: {effect}.
  => During a melee attack, after the defense roll: the attacker takes 1 wound for each block beyond the hits.
Ignores {ignores}.
  => Ignores elevation, figures and stop_terrain.
Before or after this unit's turn, you may activate {with}.
  => Before or after this unit's turn, you may activate your soldier figures.
Instead of attacking, choose {targets:sel}: {effect}.
  => Instead of attacking, choose friendly figures within 1 of this figure: remove up to 2 wounds from the target.
{who:sel} cannot be targeted. {{Braces}} stay.
  => This figure cannot be targeted. {Braces} stay.
